        },
        "quote": "(a) The Municipal Court judge shall ensure that all persons convicted of violating municipal ordinance provisions that prohibit conduct comparable to a class A or B misdemeanor or assault as defined in subsection (a) of K.S.A. 21-5412 and amendments thereto under a Kansas criminal statute are fingerprinted and processed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.680:block:0#text",
